{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wd6hMyfJK21794653172.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>早前出現微軟全球大死機，微軟稱，所有受影響產品服務都已恢復。</p><p></p><p>微軟周六表示，通訊協作平台Teams、電郵軟件Outlook等多項服務都已恢復。數據顯示，服務中斷期間，全球範圍內收到超過740萬宗故障報告，最高峰接近每分鐘兩萬宗。微軟指，沒有發現任何惡意活動，並排除了人工智能(AI)引發故障的可能。</p><p></p><p>微軟多項服務本港時間周五凌晨開始出現大規模中斷，持續時間超過24小時，為史上最長，多地政府及企業在線通訊癱瘓。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:44:37.609330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:09.183087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:37:42.086938+00:00","content_hash":"eb943d74e2ee5aecf3fda5009f544fb0f6aa0243e7f7278ebdb689d308771731","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}